 set of fully voiced-over characters and look for the answers hidden in the origins of your allies. But keep your head down, even with a legendary chaos octopus jumping on your forehead! <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080250/extras/06b89dca60cd4b0e0bb68b9a1c0454a0.poster.avif?t=1760996998\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080250/extras/06b89dca60cd4b0e0bb68b9a1c0454a0.webm?t=1760996998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>", "short_description": "Tower of Chaos is a unique combination of tactical auto battler and rogue-lite gameplay. Battle your way through the afterlife tower, manage your resources and relive the origins of your allies.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080250/header.jpg?t=1760996998", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080250/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760996998", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080250/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760996998", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> OS: Windows 7 (SP1+)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 4690T 2.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 650/R7 250<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><l